E), 55.42 (OCH3 of Z and E), 63.94 (CS' of E), 64.16 (C5' of Z), 74.34
(C3' of E), 74.46 (C3' of Z), 75.10 (MMTr-CPh3of Z), 75.22 (MMTr-CPh3 of
E), 80.44 (C4' of Z), 80.66 (C4' of E), 84.20 (C1' of Z), 84.59 (C1' of
E), 85.00 (C5 of Z), 87.43 (C5 of Z), 113.44 (MMtr-o' of Z and E), 118.91
(Im-CH-5 of E), 119.60 (Im-CH-5 of Z), 128.17 (MMTr-o of Z andE, MMTr-p
of Z), 128.44 (MMTr-p of E), 129.74 (MMTr-m of Z and E), 131.23 131.30
